{
    "title": "Stemz: AI Tool for Musicians",
    "description": "Are you looking for the best instrumental for your practice?\r\n\r\nSingers, guitarists, pianists, drummers, bass players, dancers, musicians, this app is for you! You can now play alongside your favorite artists!\r\nStemz: AI Tool for Musicians opens up new opportunities for an entire generation of music lovers.\r\n\r\nThis is a groundbreaking music app powered by cutting-edge AI technology. \r\n\r\nUnleash your musical creativity like never before with Stemz and its revolutionary Vocal and Instrument Separation features, allowing you to effortlessly extract vocals and music instruments from any song and create mesmerizing remixes with the separation feature. Take control of your favorite tracks by isolating and separation of individual instruments with the Instrument Separation tool, granting you the freedom to reimagine melodies and rhythms. Dive into a world of limitless possibilities as Stemz opens up new horizons for music enthusiasts, producers, and DJs alike - all with the power of AI. Elevate your music-making experience and immerse yourself in the future of AI-driven music innovation with Stemz.\r\n\r\nStemz contains a complete set of features:\r\n# Practice with your own tracks\r\n- Import any songs from the Files apps: iCloud, Drive, Dropbox...\r\n- Extract the audio from your Camera Rolls Videos\r\n# The most-advanced AI source separation algorithm\r\n- Select the tracks you want to edit\r\n- Extract, separate and isolate all the instruments: vocals, guitar, piano, drums, bass\r\n- Easy-to-use separation interface to remix and edit your music track\r\n- Manipulate each stemz individually thanks to sliders, or cut stemz instantly\r\n- Select the best group of stemz suiting your track\r\n# Export your mix\r\n- Share your music mix results with your friends\r\n- Standard format: M4A, CAF\r\n\r\nIt has never been easier to create your own creative performance! The application is perfect for drummers, music teachers, producers, singers, bassists, pianists, guitarists, dancers, musical beginners and professionals!\r\n\r\nStemz has been developed by a passionate team of musicians and engineers.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you looking for the best instrumental for your practice?<br><br>Singers, guitarists, pianists, drummers, bass players, dancers, musicians, this app is for you! You can now play alongside your favorite artists!<br>Stemz: AI Tool for Musicians opens up new opportunities for an entire generation of music lovers.<br><br>This is a groundbreaking music app powered by cutting-edge AI technology. <br><br>Unleash your musical creativity like never before with Stemz and its revolutionary Vocal and Instrument Separation features, allowing you to effortlessly extract vocals and music instruments from any song and create mesmerizing remixes with the separation feature. Take control of your favorite tracks by isolating and separation of individual instruments with the Instrument Separation tool, granting you the freedom to reimagine melodies and rhythms. Dive into a world of limitless possibilities as Stemz opens up new horizons for music enthusiasts, producers, and DJs alike - all with the power of AI. Elevate your music-making experience and immerse yourself in the future of AI-driven music innovation with Stemz.<br><br>Stemz contains a complete set of features:<br># Practice with your own tracks<br>- Import any songs from the Files apps: iCloud, Drive, Dropbox...<br>- Extract the audio from your Camera Rolls Videos<br># The most-advanced AI source separation algorithm<br>- Select the tracks you want to edit<br>- Extract, separate and isolate all the instruments: vocals, guitar, piano, drums, bass<br>- Easy-to-use separation interface to remix and edit your music track<br>- Manipulate each stemz individually thanks to sliders, or cut stemz instantly<br>- Select the best group of stemz suiting your track<br># Export your mix<br>- Share your music mix results with your friends<br>- Standard format: M4A, CAF<br><br>It has never been easier to create your own creative performance! The application is perfect for drummers, music teachers, producers, singers, bassists, pianists, guitarists, dancers, musical beginners and professionals!<br><br>Stemz has been developed by a passionate team of musicians and engineers.",
